---@field change_height fun(handle:MT2RegionHandle, position:number[], up:boolean, radius?:number):MT2Action Use the original height brush once and confirm the complete grid, 100 cash payment, restored cursor and unchanged Undo history.
---@field contours fun(handle:MT2RegionHandle, style:integer, path?:integer, offset?:integer, limit?:integer):MT2TerrainContourPage Read a bounded page of exact native integer terrain polygon coordinates.
---@field paint fun(handle:MT2RegionHandle, style:integer, stamps:MT2TerrainStamp[], label?:string):MT2Action Complete an original terrain paint stroke and confirm its contour inverse, native Undo, Region and ledger readback. The result states whether contours changed.
