---@class MT2WallsAPI
---@field place_curve fun(curve:MT2WallCurve):MT2Action Compute and place a native Wall curve from 2..11 ordered control points. Original AddPointAt calculates segment velocities and PlotSpline samples and validates terrain/collisions, supplying the native preview and spline-length price quote. The same isolated native receiver owns Purchase/Finish and model/ghost cleanup. Returns native spline records and sampled preview, created Path/node handles, changed and removed split Paths, cost and an owned history receipt. Requires one owned active-root Region; supplied endpoint handles pin native intersections/split Paths. Original validation causes are retained and uncertain actions must not be replayed.
---@field place fun(plan:MT2WallPlan):MT2Action Execute a bounded explicit native Wall plan through isolated original Wall/Path/model construction, native Purchase and Finish, then owned cleanup. Native ghost Length supplies the price quote. Supports explicit current node and split-Path handles, including preview split targets. Confirms reciprocal mixed topology, created Path family/scene, retained original Undo and unchanged unrelated Paths. Returns created Paths, native length, cost and owned history receipt.

